Debug.Assert(OLD(ArrayList.Count) == _size);
</code>

This assert statement is related to the fact that the count of items in the ArrayList is equal to the "_size" variable. This is because "_size" is responsible for keeping track of the number of actual items in the list (i.e., not including any default capacity beyond this size), and the Count property is used in other classes to get the actual number of items in the ArrayList.
